00:13:45,260 --> 00:13:46,840
You're carrying around my hair.

263
00:13:47,060 --> 00:13:48,740
So I know you're a little sweet on me.

264
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:50,220
Listen.

265
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:52,220
I'm right, yeah?

266
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:52,980
You're ripe.

267
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:54,000
You're really stinky.

268
00:13:54,460 --> 00:13:54,860
Seriously?

269
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,040
What do you mean?

270
00:13:56,100 --> 00:13:57,840
Like what kind of smell is it anyway?

271
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,040
Hot garbage.

272
00:13:59,040 --> 00:14:03,700
I have to go and take a bath right this minute before I die and then come back because I can't die!

273
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,480
Just go bathe.

274
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,660
I'm going over to Valkyrie's.

275
00:14:07,660 --> 00:14:13,860
Hey, Circeus.

276
00:14:13,860 --> 00:14:15,160
About time for you, too?

277
00:14:15,420 --> 00:14:18,740
Couldn't just walk around the rest of the day covered in cake, could I?

278
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:24,020
The whole idea was for it to go in my face, not get smeared all over it.

279
00:14:24,180 --> 00:14:24,900
That's fair.

280
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,060
Was it any good?

281
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:28,460
No, of course it wasn't any damn good.

282
00:14:28,560 --> 00:14:29,680
It was way too salty.

283
00:14:29,860 --> 00:14:31,220
It tasted like tears.

284
00:14:31,480 --> 00:14:32,140
Oh, right.

285
00:14:32,420 --> 00:14:32,740
Sorry.

286
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,940
Hey, that reminds me.

287
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:38,280
Ishtar was looking for you earlier.

288
00:14:38,740 --> 00:14:40,560
Do you know what she wanted to talk about?

289
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:43,980
If I had to guess, I'd say it was about that demon you let in.

290
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:46,180
Like I'm 99% sure.

291
00:14:47,060 --> 00:14:49,740
Ugh, I'm going to have to see her smelling all funky.

292
00:14:50,220 --> 00:14:52,580
Well, Rista, I'm glad you stopped by.

293
00:14:52,940 --> 00:14:53,620
Hey, look.

294
00:14:53,780 --> 00:14:55,500
I'm sorry about that whole Reaper drama.

295
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:56,900
Oh, don't be silly.

296
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:59,000
That was not your fault, dear.

297
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:01,640
Besides, Valkyrie took care of it, didn't she?

298
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:03,640
It's not even an issue.

299
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:06,440
Then why were you looking for me?

300
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:11,880
It appears that the last of the four heavenly kings is making a move down on Gea Brande.

301
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:14,900
He's leading a demon army to overthrow the capital.

302
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:16,680
Oh, Rosalie's in trouble.

303
00:15:17,180 --> 00:15:19,520
There is simply no time left to spare.

304
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:22,340
So you must return to Gea Brande at once.

305
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:23,160
Yes, ma'am.

306
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:24,240
I'll go right now.

307
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:29,300
I mean, hurry, but you still have time to take a bath, I'm sure.

308
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:33,980
Perhaps it's your long journey, but you smell a touch, Gaini.

309
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:40,280
Whoa, Rista, what's going on with your skin?

310
00:15:40,560 --> 00:15:41,860
Oh, a sunburn.

311
00:15:42,180 --> 00:15:45,040
I'm just a delicate, sweet-smelling little flower after all.

312
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:46,040
I don't stink!

313
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:46,920
I can't stink!

314
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:48,180
I will never stink again!

315
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:49,780
Well, enough about me.

316
00:15:50,180 --> 00:15:52,460
How did Mosh and Elu-Lu's training go?

317
00:15:52,980 --> 00:15:53,500
Excellent.

318
00:15:53,900 --> 00:15:55,400
You're in for a big surprise.

319
00:15:55,400 --> 00:16:09,800
He has mastered his metamorphosis, and she was able to upgrade her haste spell to Quick.

320
00:16:09,940 --> 00:16:11,540
I'm very proud of both of them.

321
00:16:11,580 --> 00:16:13,460
We have been working our tails off here.

322
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:15,940
We want to help Seiya as much as we can.

323
00:16:16,180 --> 00:16:17,740
Wow, that's awesome.

324
00:16:18,020 --> 00:16:18,900
You guys are great.

325
00:16:19,000 --> 00:16:21,440
We couldn't have done it without Arya to teach us.

326
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:22,980
Yeah, thank you so much.

327
00:16:22,980 --> 00:16:24,700
Alrighty, then.

328
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:27,840
I gotta get my butt in gear so these Rugrats don't show me up.

329
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:30,560
I'll prove to Seiya I'm more than just a pretty face.

330
00:16:31,140 --> 00:16:31,960
Excuse me!

331
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:32,900
Coming in!

332
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:35,520
Ah!

333
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:39,760
Wait, wait, wait!

334
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:43,640
I knew you two were playing around earlier, but you're really not supposed to be doing this!

335
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:45,280
Put some other pants on now!

336
00:16:45,660 --> 00:16:47,220
Once again, you don't get it.

337
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:48,800
We're just training in here.

338
00:16:48,980 --> 00:16:50,120
Oh, can you blame me?

339
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:53,940
What's the point of having a beefcake around if you can't grab yourself a slice?

340
00:16:54,140 --> 00:16:58,100
But still, hot, sweaty, sweet relations between a goddess and a mortal is forbidden!

341
00:16:59,060 --> 00:16:59,540
Ugh.

342
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:02,020
You have no clue how things work around here.

343
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:04,060
This is why I can't stand novices.

344
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:08,320
I may not have much, but I am trying as hard as I possibly can.

345
00:17:08,600 --> 00:17:11,900
I've been working like crazy all day to make this so I can help Seiya!

346
00:17:11,900 --> 00:17:13,400
What is that thing?

347
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:15,120
Some kind of gross doll?

348
00:17:15,340 --> 00:17:16,340
Was it in the trash?

349
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:19,320
Looks like it was woven out of oily golden thread.

350
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,600
Wait, you gotta be kidding me!

351
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:22,560
Did you...

352
00:17:22,560 --> 00:17:24,040
I sure did!

353
00:17:24,220 --> 00:17:27,320
I made this doll out of hair that I pulled out of my own head!

354
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,580
And I've dubbed her...

355
00:17:28,580 --> 00:17:30,420
You're out of your damn mind!

356
00:17:30,800 --> 00:17:33,760
I figured it would come in handy for Seiya's synthesis skill!

357
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:36,180
So I yanked them out in little clumps!

358
00:17:36,380 --> 00:17:38,600
It hurts so bad, but worth it!

359
00:17:38,900 --> 00:17:41,320
The level of psychotic just doesn't work for me.

360
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:43,220
I won't squeeze your boobs again.

361
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:46,160
Hey, Rista, you feeling okay?

362
00:17:46,500 --> 00:17:48,920
I don't really think this is a great look for you.

363
00:17:50,060 --> 00:17:52,820
I just thought this would help Seiya when he needs it.

364
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:57,380
But now that I stop and look at it, this is restraining order level crazy!

365
00:17:58,620 --> 00:17:59,700
I'm sorry!

366
00:17:59,800 --> 00:18:00,940
Stop it, it's disgusting.

367
00:18:01,340 --> 00:18:02,320
Don't leak it on me.

368
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:04,300
I just want you to like me!

369
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:06,740
Seiya, how can I make you like me?

370
00:18:07,040 --> 00:18:08,360
Cleaning up your snot would help.

371
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:12,800
But why, out of all of the goddesses here, would you choose that old ugly pain freak over me?

372
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:14,520
That was just Valkyrieja training.

373
00:18:15,240 --> 00:18:18,140
Remember, I told you that you didn't understand what was going on.

374
00:18:18,200 --> 00:18:20,560
You cross your heart and swear to God you mean that?

375
00:18:20,580 --> 00:18:21,460
That is so stupid.

376
00:18:22,060 --> 00:18:23,080
You are a god.

377
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,020
Okay, then.

378
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,540
It's pretty unbelievable.

379
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:29,040
But still, I trust you.

380
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:32,600
Mosh, put this item in my bag.

381
00:18:33,740 --> 00:18:35,380
Sure, if you say so.

382
00:18:37,720 --> 00:18:39,960
Well, anyway, did you get enough training?

383
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:40,940
Oh, yeah.

384
00:18:41,060 --> 00:18:41,960
What about you, Master?

385
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:43,020
Mm-hmm.

386
00:18:43,140 --> 00:18:45,860
That's great news, because we've got to get back to Gabrande.

387
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:48,780
Apparently, the last Heavenly King is attacking the capital.

388
00:18:48,780 --> 00:18:51,780
Okay, let's get going.

389
00:18:52,740 --> 00:18:55,220
Looking back, I was just too worked up to notice.

390
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:57,780
But Seiya never said his catchphrase.

391
00:18:58,240 --> 00:18:59,460
I'm perfectly prepared.

392
00:18:59,460 --> 00:19:08,300
Don't let those creatures douse your courage.

393
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:12,300
Remember, what we're all fighting for today is the future of Rosegard!

394
00:19:12,480 --> 00:19:14,820
Wow, it's turned into an all-out war.

395
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:17,480
We've been eagerly awaiting your arrival, hero.

396
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:23,720
The Heavenly King, Eraser Kaiser, has been marching his elite force of the Demon Lord's army towards our city walls.

397
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:27,640
The men who met them on the battlefront have been made to retreat in terror.

398
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:30,400
The fight has finally come to our doorstep.

399
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:32,400
So it's a do-or-die moment here.

400
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:33,300
Hmm.

401
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:36,760
That one gives off a completely different aura from the rest.

402
00:19:37,200 --> 00:19:38,300
He's the one in charge.

403
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:39,720
Eraser Kaiser.

404
00:19:40,720 --> 00:19:44,740
Besides our interdimensional stalker, he's the strongest enemy we've faced so far.

405
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:49,660
I challenge you to send your mightiest human to face me in battle.

406
00:19:49,660 --> 00:19:52,160
Or are there only weaklings in your kingdom?

407
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:55,960
The War Master!

408
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:57,440
Show them all we need to!

409
00:19:57,620 --> 00:19:59,800
This fight's as good as over, boys!

410
00:20:00,260 --> 00:20:02,640
That guy's the greatest warrior in the capital?

411
00:20:03,180 --> 00:20:03,640
Yeah.

412
00:20:03,940 --> 00:20:05,440
He's kinda old, don't he think?

413
00:20:08,240 --> 00:20:10,420
They sent out a dusty old fart.

414
00:20:10,860 --> 00:20:13,000
I had asked for a fight, not a sacrifice.

415
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:15,920
Seiya, you need to go and help him!

416
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:18,100
Actually, I don't think I will.

417
00:20:18,380 --> 00:20:18,620
Huh?

418
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:21,720
If it's a sacrifice you want, then that's what you'll get.

419
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,360
Witness the power of my evil six-mode!

420
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,400
Crushing Saint's Light.

421
00:20:33,060 --> 00:20:34,700
Oh, what?

422
00:20:34,980 --> 00:20:35,800
No way.

423
00:20:36,340 --> 00:20:37,920
But you're just a human.

424
00:20:38,520 --> 00:20:39,600
Not even a hero!

425
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:46,180
Whoa, crazy!

426
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:47,620
One-shot Grandpa!

427
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,100
Grandpa, reach me!

428
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:57,960
Purify with massive saint's life.

429
00:20:57,960 --> 00:21:12,980
Now those are some stats!

430
00:21:13,100 --> 00:21:14,600
A human can get up there.

431
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:19,140
Fair goddess, it is an honor to meet you at last.

432
00:21:19,660 --> 00:21:23,100
If this old man has stolen your hero's thunder, I humbly ask forgiveness.

433
00:21:23,100 --> 00:21:24,980
Oh, there's no need to apologize.

434
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:28,980
I'm actually extremely grateful to you for defeating that heavenly king.

435
00:21:29,220 --> 00:21:31,580
That old dude is like a walking force of nature!

436
00:21:31,820 --> 00:21:34,500
He took out that big six-armed monster thing like it was nothing!

437
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:39,820
If you can wield this kind of power, why aren't you joining the battle to take down the demon lord?

438
00:21:40,600 --> 00:21:41,400
Long story.

439
00:21:42,220 --> 00:21:42,620
Okay?

440
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:45,520
This can't be!

441
00:21:45,660 --> 00:21:46,920
It's starting to happen again!

442
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:49,020
Please, clear the area now!

443
00:21:49,540 --> 00:21:50,060
Get moving!

444
00:21:50,520 --> 00:21:53,000
This guy is looking like death-eating a cracker.

445
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:54,960
Maybe he's sick and can't leave the capital.

446
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:56,160
This is his condition.

447
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:59,820
Our brave war master is infantilizing!

448
00:22:00,620 --> 00:22:00,920
Huh?

449
00:22:03,220 --> 00:22:03,780
Huh?

450
00:22:04,600 --> 00:22:05,120
Mommy!

451
00:22:05,740 --> 00:22:08,140
I made Boom Boom in my diapy again!

452
00:22:08,140 --> 00:22:09,140
Huh?

453
00:22:23,100 --> 00:22:24,840
Please say it!

454
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:29,440
H cupoの出るALIかとステータスを

455
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:32,200
強さも不器用さも

456
00:22:32,200 --> 00:22:35,700
キミは特別すぎたよ

457
00:22:35,700 --> 00:22:37,520
魔法だって

458
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:41,140
解けない謎の横顔で

459
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:44,480
見つめた明日

460
00:22:44,480 --> 00:23:14,460
We'll see you next time.

